  "description": "High-performance .NET 10 client library for MercadoBitcoin API v4. Features: native HTTP/2 with optional HTTP/3 (QUIC), System.Text.Json with Source Generators for AOT compatibility, WebSocket streaming API, IAsyncEnumerable support, zero-allocation hot paths with Span/Memory, ObjectPool for resource reuse, Polly v8 resilience policies, comprehensive metrics (System.Diagnostics.Metrics), 77+ integration tests, and clean architecture. Optimized for high-throughput trading systems with sub-millisecond latency targets.",
